      "content": "\"resting\" isnt really an option though. if i stop for a second the whole thing just collapses. the bills dont stop, the expectations dont stop, the feeling of being a failure just stays there. it feels less like i need a break and more like there's just no way out of this loop. it's like i'm trapped in a room with no doors.",
