    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've tried all that. talking to people just makes it feel more real, like i have to explain how much of a mess i am over and over again. it doesn't actually fix any of the debt or the job or the fact that i've just wasted so many years of my life for nothing. it's just... exhausting to exist when everything is this broken. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just stop everything. entirely.",
